#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to use a virtual private endpoint to privately connect to IBM Quantum Platform."
msgstr "Cómo usar un endpoint privado virtual para conectarse de forma privada a IBM Quantum Platform."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use virtual private endpoints for VPC to privately connect to IBM Quantum Platform"
msgstr "Usar endpoints privados virtuales para VPC y conectarse de forma privada a IBM Quantum Platform"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use virtual private endpoints for VPC to privately connect to IBM Quantum Platform {#use-virtual-private-endpoints-for-vpc-to-privately-connect-to-ibm-quantum-platform}"
msgstr "Usar endpoints privados virtuales para VPC y conectarse de forma privada a IBM Quantum Platform {#use-virtual-private-endpoints-for-vpc-to-privately-connect-to-ibm-quantum-platform}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use Virtual Private Endpoints (VPE) for [Virtual Private Cloud (VPC)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc) to connect to IBM Quantum&reg; from your VPC network. The connection uses the IP address that you specify, allocated from a subnet within your VPC.\n"
msgstr "Usa Endpoints Privados Virtuales (VPE) para [Virtual Private Cloud (VPC)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc) para conectarte a IBM Quantum&reg; desde tu red VPC. La conexión usa la dirección IP que especifiques, asignada desde una subred dentro de tu VPC.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "VPEs are virtual IP interfaces that are bound to an endpoint gateway created on a per-service basis. The endpoint gateway is a virtualized function that scales horizontally, is redundant and highly available, and spans all availability zones of your VPC. Endpoint gateways enable communications from virtual server instances within your VPC and IBM Cloud&reg; service on the private backbone. VPE for VPC lets you control all private addressing within your cloud. For more information, see [About virtual private endpoint gateways](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-about-vpe).\n"
msgstr "Los VPE son interfaces IP virtuales que están vinculadas a un gateway de endpoint creado por servicio. El gateway de endpoint es una función virtualizada que escala horizontalmente, es redundante y de alta disponibilidad, y abarca todas las zonas de disponibilidad de tu VPC. Los gateways de endpoint permiten las comunicaciones entre las instancias de servidor virtual dentro de tu VPC y el servicio IBM Cloud&reg; sobre la red troncal privada. VPE para VPC te permite controlar todo el direccionamiento privado dentro de tu nube. Para obtener más información, consulta [Acerca de los gateways de endpoint privado virtual](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-about-vpe).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Regardless of whether you use VPEs, all internal communication within IBM Quantum Platform's network always uses private connections rather than the public internet.\n"
msgstr "Independientemente de si usas VPEs, toda la comunicación interna dentro de la red de IBM Quantum Platform siempre usa conexiones privadas en lugar de la internet pública.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Whether your connection to IBM Quantum Platform itself is public or private depends on whether you use a VPE. Connecting through the public endpoints transmits all request and response data over the public internet. Connecting through a VPE keeps that traffic on the private network instead.\n"
msgstr "Si tu conexión a IBM Quantum Platform en sí es pública o privada depende de si usas un VPE. Conectarte a través de los endpoints públicos transmite todos los datos de solicitud y respuesta a través de la internet pública. Conectarte a través de un VPE mantiene ese tráfico en la red privada en su lugar.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "VPEs are supported only for the IBM Quantum Platform API and SDK, as described in the following sections. The IBM Quantum Platform website does not support VPEs and can only be accessed over the public network.\n"
msgstr "Los VPEs solo son compatibles con la API y el SDK de IBM Quantum Platform, como se describe en las siguientes secciones. El sitio web de IBM Quantum Platform no admite VPEs y solo se puede acceder a él a través de la red pública.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Antes de comenzar {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you target a VPE for IBM Quantum Platform, complete the following steps:\n"
msgstr "Antes de apuntar a un VPE para IBM Quantum Platform, completa los siguientes pasos:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Create a Virtual Private Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-getting-started).\n"
msgstr "[Crea una nube privada virtual](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-getting-started).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Plan for the network topology](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpe-planning-considerations) to connect to VPEs.\n"
msgstr "[Planifica la topología de red](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpe-planning-considerations) para conectarte a los VPE.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Set access controls](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-configure-acls-sgs-endpoint-gateways) for your VPE.\n"
msgstr "[Configura los controles de acceso](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-configure-acls-sgs-endpoint-gateways) para tu VPE.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Understand the [service restrictions](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-limitations).\n"
msgstr "Comprende las [restricciones del servicio](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-limitations).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Understand how to [view VPE details](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpe-viewing-details-of-an-endpoint-gateway).\n"
msgstr "Aprende a [ver los detalles del VPE](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpe-viewing-details-of-an-endpoint-gateway).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up a VPE for IBM Quantum Platform {#set-up-a-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-platform}"
msgstr "Configurar un VPE para IBM Quantum Platform {#set-up-a-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-platform}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are several ways to create a VPE gateway. If you use the [CLI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpc-reference&interface=cli#vpe-clis) or [API](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/vpc/latest#create-endpoint-gateway), you must specify the [Cloud Resource Name (CRN)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-crn) of the region in which you want connect to IBM Quantum Platform. Review the following table for the available regions and CRNs.\n"
msgstr "Hay varias formas de crear un gateway VPE. Si usas la [CLI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpc-reference&interface=cli#vpe-clis) o la [API](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/vpc/latest#create-endpoint-gateway), debes especificar el [Nombre de recurso en la nube (CRN)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-crn) de la región en la que deseas conectarte a IBM Quantum Platform. Consulta la siguiente tabla para ver las regiones y CRN disponibles.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Region | Plans   | Fully Qualified Domain Name (FQDN) | Cloud Resource Name (CRN) |\n"
"|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|\n"
"| `us-east` | `Standard` | `private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:us-east:::endpoint:private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"
"| `eu-de` | `Standard` | `private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:eu-de:::endpoint:private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Región | Planes   | Nombre de dominio completamente calificado (FQDN) | Nombre de recurso en la nube (CRN) |\n"
"|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|\n"
"| `us-east` | `Standard` | `private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:us-east:::endpoint:private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"
"| `eu-de` | `Standard` | `private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:eu-de:::endpoint:private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuring an endpoint gateway {#configuring-an-endpoint-gateway}"
msgstr "Configurar un gateway de endpoint {#configuring-an-endpoint-gateway}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To configure a VPE gateway, follow these steps:\n"
msgstr "Para configurar un gateway VPE, sigue estos pasos:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "List the available services, including IBM Cloud infrastructure services available (by default) for all VPC users.\n"
msgstr "Lista los servicios disponibles, incluidos los servicios de infraestructura de IBM Cloud disponibles (de forma predeterminada) para todos los usuarios de VPC.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Create an endpoint gateway](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-ordering-endpoint-gateway) for IBM Quantum Platform that you want to be privately available to the VPC.\n"
msgstr "[Crea un gateway de endpoint](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-ordering-endpoint-gateway) para IBM Quantum Platform que desees que esté disponible de forma privada en la VPC.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Bind a reserved IP address](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-bind-unbind-reserved-ip) to the endpoint gateway.\n"
msgstr "[Vincula una dirección IP reservada](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-bind-unbind-reserved-ip) al gateway de endpoint.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[View the created VPE gateways](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpe-viewing-details-of-an-endpoint-gateway) associated with IBM Quantum Platform.\n"
msgstr "[Consulta los gateways VPE creados](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpe-viewing-details-of-an-endpoint-gateway) asociados con IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now your virtual server instances in the VPC can access your IBM Quantum Platform instance privately.\n"
msgstr "Ahora las instancias de servidor virtual en la VPC pueden acceder a tu instancia de IBM Quantum Platform de forma privada.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use your VPE for IBM Quantum Platform {#use-your-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-platform}"
msgstr "Usar tu VPE para IBM Quantum Platform {#use-your-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-platform}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After you create an endpoint gateway for IBM Quantum Platform, follow these steps:\n"
msgstr "Después de crear un gateway de endpoint para IBM Quantum Platform, sigue estos pasos:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the VPE with `qiskit-ibm-runtime` (Python SDK) {#use-the-vpe-with-qiskit-ibm-runtime-python-sdk}"
msgstr "Usar el VPE con `qiskit-ibm-runtime` (SDK de Python) {#use-the-vpe-with-qiskit-ibm-runtime-python-sdk}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"VPE support requires `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.24.0 or later.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"La compatibilidad con VPE requiere `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.24.0 o posterior.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When instantiating `QiskitRuntimeService`, specify `private_endpoint=True`.\n"
msgstr "Al instanciar `QiskitRuntimeService`, especifica `private_endpoint=True`.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the VPE with the IBM Quantum API {#use-the-vpe-with-the-ibm-quantum-api}"
msgstr "Usar el VPE con la API de IBM Quantum {#use-the-vpe-with-the-ibm-quantum-api}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After creating an endpoint gateway for IBM Quantum Platform, use the service endpoint's fully qualified domain name (FQDN) for the target region from [the prior table](#set-up-a-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-platform).\n"
msgstr "Después de crear un gateway de endpoint para IBM Quantum Platform, usa el nombre de dominio completamente calificado (FQDN) del endpoint del servicio para la región de destino de [la tabla anterior](#set-up-a-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-platform).\n"
